From {{inh|enm|ang|fīf}}, from {{inh|enm|gmw-pro|*fimf}}, from {{inh|enm|gem-pro|*fimf}}, from {{inh|enm|ine-pro|*pénkʷe}}.

Though {{m+|ang|fīf}} was usually indeclinable, inflected forms of it are far from unknown. Forms with final ''-v-'' originate from intervocalic voicing in these inflected forms.

